{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control","id":1416884,"title":"Ideas for Control","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-05T11:37:26-07:00","id":1416884,"title":"Ideas for Control","content":"So how about some different ideas or even fleshed out characters that make up Control. I liked how some hints of Inhuman forces are taking over the Conventions like The Computer In Autochthonia, but this usually is depicted outside of Control. But it would be funny if Control was just five different inhuman god things standing on each other\u2019s shoulders wearing a human trench coat and maybe they don\u2019t even know about each other.<br /> <br /> There is the idea Control is heavily if not completely compromised by the Nephandi.<br /> <br /> And then there is the fact that Conventions constantly reimagined themselves so Archscientists In Control would kind of be the only remnants of their older conventions, as well as the idea of many being archaic, so the irony of the most advanced Scientists are fellas that would use clockwork nano-machines made of wood and glass.<br /> <br /> But how many members would you imagine are in Control? Have you made actual characters for Control in your games?<br /> <br /> I like the idea after the dimensional anomaly that banished masters and above beyond the gauntlet the techies lost most of their control over individual members so while they are organized they are much less supervised with much less oversight. They still have a hierarchy and duty, kind of like the Garou Nation, but they have more freedom to achieve their goals as they wish it\u2019s just you are cut off from most resources unless you tie yourself deeper into the organization and duties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-05T13:00:30-07:00","id":1416893,"title":"","content":"I think guide of the Technocracy said control was a hive mind like thing that Technocrats over a certain rank get added to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-05T14:18:28-07:00","id":1416901,"title":"","content":"I like to think of it as the Sibyl system from Psycho/Pass. Just a big room full of brains in jars making all the decisions.....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-05T17:58:47-07:00","id":1416917,"title":"","content":"I would make them all have their categorical sub realms, and also all of them rather human in aspect. After all, the Technocracy was created by humans, for humans, to deal with a strange and magical world. It would not do for the heads of humanity's defenders to turn inhuman.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T05:38:52-07:00","id":1416971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1416917#post1416917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would make them all have their categorical sub realms, and also all of them rather human in aspect. After all, the Technocracy was created by humans, for humans, to deal with a strange and magical world. It would not do for the heads of humanity's defenders to turn inhuman.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s good thematically, I guess, maybe there Technocracy Archmage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T06:00:20-07:00","id":1416976,"title":"","content":"Never really thought about this, but great question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T06:04:54-07:00","id":1416979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1416971#post1416971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s good thematically, I guess, maybe there Technocracy Archmage.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I was to make it so that there had to be a face to face.... I would make it so that they all met in a room much like most conference rooms we see in the Western world. Of course any mage worth their salt in that room would be pissing their pants in terror at what they are capable of, but any human observer would be struck at how utterly mundane the place would look.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T07:30:08-07:00","id":1416986,"title":"","content":"Yeah it\u2019s hilariously funny to imagine a Archmaster of Godly power who has 7 dots in all the spheres, and he goes has a cleaner press his or her suit and then just walks in to discuss the budget.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T08:47:25-07:00","id":1417000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1416986#post1416986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah it\u2019s hilariously funny to imagine a Archmaster of Godly power who has 7 dots in all the spheres, and he goes has a cleaner press his or her suit and then just walks in to discuss the budget.</div> </div> </div> </div>And of course, what better form can the secret masters of the world than to be a very part of the world itself? What better aesthetic for the leaders of a movement meant to create a clockwork universe that is utterly predictable and controllable, than the very mundane and the ordinary? <br /> <br /> The sheer incongruity is the point. Like that moment in 2001 where David Bowman falls into the Monolith, and wakes up in a hotel room.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T09:43:48-07:00","id":1417011,"title":"","content":"I always play Control with a capital C as more of a Dread Pirate Roberts situation.<br /> <br /> It's less an actual organization or group, and more a psychological tool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-07T16:43:45-07:00","id":1417218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1416893#post1416893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think guide of the Technocracy said control was a hive mind like thing that Technocrats over a certain rank get added to.</div> </div> </div> </div>According to GttTech, they're all sitting in a dark room staring at a glowing polyhedron.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T04:28:39-07:00","id":1419350,"title":"","content":"The Progenitor is this unimaginably beautiful woman. She simultaneously occupies five clones of herself. The Syndicate guy is a sex addict and generally votes with her. The New Word Order guy runs a psychic library of immeasurable value. He keeps the minutes. The Iteration X is a Golem, because robots weren't available back when he made the change. The Void Engineer looks like a grey alien and is the only one who truly understands the Iterator.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T05:01:55-07:00","id":1419353,"title":"","content":"Come to think of it, what exactly is Control? I know they were created from the order of reason, but did they ever split up into the 5 conventions like in the future ?<br /> <br /> The organisation of control may be organised along factions and groups that no longer meaningfully exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T08:40:41-07:00","id":1419377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1419350#post1419350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Progenitor is this unimaginably beautiful woman. She simultaneously occupies five clones of herself. The Syndicate guy is a sex addict and generally votes with her. The New Word Order guy runs a psychic library of immeasurable value. He keeps the minutes. The Iteration X is a Golem, because robots weren't available back when he made the change. The Void Engineer looks like a grey alien and is the only one who truly understands the Iterator.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s great I presume the iteration x guys Jewish?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T09:05:23-07:00","id":1419382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1419377#post1419377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s great I presume the iteration x guys Jewish?</div> </div> </div> </div>Could you please stop being passive aggressive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T15:52:56-07:00","id":1419468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1419382#post1419382\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Could you please stop being passive aggressive.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure. If this was passive aggressive he would be pointing out the syndicate guy. <br /> <br /> I think he's referring to the fact golems are from Jewish mythology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-21T16:27:36-07:00","id":1419475,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1419468#post1419468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure. If this was passive aggressive he would be pointing out the syndicate guy.<br /> <br /> I think he's referring to the fact golems are from Jewish mythology.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tolkien was Jewish. He certainly built Middle Earth with a lot of mythology from outside Jewish culture. We don't hold that against him. Had he not taken from a variety of sources, we wouldn't have Orcs and other staples of modern fantasy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1419377#post1419377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s great I presume the iteration x guys Jewish?</div> </div> </div> </div>As much as an iterator can be religious. They tend to revere Computer or some super-AI god. Culturally, sure, his way of ensuring his roots are represented in the new Consensus. I'm sure a modern day Jewish Biomechanic wouldn't be refused hypertech cybernetic upgrades, &quot;You have to be a golem.&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T02:42:16-07:00","id":1420095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1419468#post1419468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure. If this was passive aggressive he would be pointing out the syndicate guy. <br /> <br /> I think he's referring to the fact golems are from Jewish mythology.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes that\u2019s what I meant if he\u2019s a golem from the 11 to 16 century he\u2019ll be Jewish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T11:17:05-07:00","id":1420147,"title":"","content":"I would contest the *need* to be jewish. It's reasonable to say it would be more likely, but I see not why other magicians wouldn't have copied the formula. I think Mage assumes cultural exchange it's a thing, especially after the formation of the big Factions.<br /> <br /> <b>That being said</b>, I do think it would be *better* if was jewish to honor the RL literature on Golems that we have. Very few people are going to be offended by their culture being glamorized as magical. But I think something it's lost if we wash everything neutral, and then people can't see any relation between the (maybe *their*) culture and the awesome fictional characters.<br /> <br /> Being a fan of &quot;The Golem&quot; by<i> Gustav Meyrink</i>, I'm disturbed by the fact some people would regard as &quot;aggresive&quot; to relate Golems to Jews.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1419475#post1419475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tolkien was Jewish. He certainly built Middle Earth with a lot of mythology from outside Jewish culture. We don't hold that against him. Had he not taken from a variety of sources, we wouldn't have Orcs and other staples of modern fantasy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Note that Orcs with all those staples are a racist stereotype. A world where hegemonically regarded as beautiful white humanoids are created by the good gods, while hegemonically regarded as ugly non-white humanoids are created by the evil gods, and don't deserve better than dying.<br /> <br /> Maybe not the best example to defend the moral high ground.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 10-25-2020, 02:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T16:54:48-07:00","id":1420179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420147#post1420147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Note that Orcs with all those staples are a racist stereotype. A world where hegemonically regarded as beautiful white humanoids are created by the good gods, while hegemonically regarded as ugly non-white humanoids are created by the evil gods, and don't deserve better than dying.</div> </div> </div> </div>I question author-intent vs perceived result. I don't think Tolkien was thinking in terms of the type skin color issues everyone is obsessing over at present. Mandatory unconscious bias re-education wasn't available in his time. Fantasy should be a place in which it safe to conceptualize a visually distinct race as evil or driven toward inevitable conflict with one's own fantastic alter-ego-people. We can distinguish between creatures presented in much-needed escapist fantasy and the endless, fatiguing, finger-pointing contest that has enveloped us. A social justice utopia lacks conflict, which is the core element of fiction. Equally, someone using fiction to create their picture of &quot;the world as it should be&quot;, using original ideas, should be encouraged. <br /> <br /> What present day issues can we draw from that unite everyone? Man (everyone who shares the planet) vs Nature is a really good theme to build on in our current ecological crisis. Man versus Man - a multicultural corporate class, holding an extended extinction-orgy vs the other 7+ billion people. Man versus Himself - consumer culture, personal privacy traded for convenience, debt-cycle and credit cards.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T17:16:56-07:00","id":1420184,"title":"","content":".... I don't want a Jewish golem.<br /> <br /> Remember all those conspiracy theories where Jews secretly run the world?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T18:16:25-07:00","id":1420190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420184#post1420184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">.... I don't want a Jewish golem.<br /> <br /> Remember all those conspiracy theories where Jews secretly run the world?</div> </div> </div> </div>Fortunate that:<br /> - The writing for Technocracy Reloaded has mostly all been done.<br /> - It's unlikely anyone here or at Onyx wants to use an ItX golem to advance such ideas, which they have spoken against, generally.<br /> - Mages are defined by their awakened avatar. You can have a Twin Souls merit that connects two people from different cultures on a level deeper than that which could divide them. Past Lives background can connect you to multi-incarnation, multi-perspective memories that span human history and geography.<br /> - Jodi Blake rules the world.<br /> - My ItX character is an Earth Elemental. He was never human. He just rolled in one day, having tunneled into the construct from under the ground. He seemed peaceful. They figured that if he could do that, he might be useful, so they let him join Control as the ItX rep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":".  word used, clarity 10-26-2020, 12:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T19:42:07-07:00","id":1420199,"title":"","content":"I was more thinking that mage the ascension has the technocracy as a pastiche of various right wing conspiracy theories. New World Order, mind control drugs, globalists, secret bankers, academia...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T21:51:22-07:00","id":1420215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420199#post1420199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was more thinking that mage the ascension has the technocracy as a pastiche of various right wing conspiracy theories. New World Order, mind control drugs, globalists, secret bankers, academia...</div> </div> </div> </div>I will address mind control drugs separately, at the bottom. The other four things you list are institutional-interest conspiracies, not defined by ethnicity. <br /> <br /> I will give you three examples of a conspiracy.<br /> <br /> 1. Broke drug addicts plan to hold up a bank. They use stop watches and generally plan how to get onto a major highway and escape with the money. If they are caught, they will be prosecuted for Conspiracy, along with other charges. When it's poor criminals, there is no allegation of racism against the prosecutor.<br /> <br /> 2. In the country I live in, executives from a handful of grocery store chains met in secret and agreed to fix the price of bread to maximize profit. Bread went up to a ridiculous price. Years later, a mainstream TV-news outlet did a story that exposed the collusion. One person who had pushed for the truth was the director of an organization that advocates for poor families, generally associated with the Left Wing.<br /> <br /> 3. Planned Obsolescence is a documented conspiracy to design products we buy that have electrical or mechanical components to break so that we are forced to buy them again. Besides profit, the moral rational for doing this is that it keeps factory workers, truckers and merchants employed, keeping the economy from stagnating. The cost is all of the hydrocarbons burned unnecessarily to produce and transport things that wouldn't otherwise need replacing, landfill pollution, a crisis of credit card debt and resulting divorce and suicide.<br /> <br /> Michael Moore's film, &quot;Capitalism, a Love Story&quot; contains interviews with American politicians who say that the 2008 financial crisis was &quot;supposed to happen&quot;. Here we have a Left Wing film producer pointing at bankers and Republican politicians. They are not characterized by their ethnicity, in the film. <br /> <br /> Mage requires a fictional conspiracy to explain why Sleepers remain Sleepers. If the Technocracy announced itself, the World of Darkness would change in a way that doesn't support many of the fun themes my chronicles rely on. If you love Mage, but are frustrated with how the Technocracy is portrayed, have them announce themselves in your chronicle. The public debate that would follow would be interesting. I watch Onyx Path's YouTube channel. They are definitely not right wing. If White Wolf used right wing propaganda as a source of material for the fiction, I am glad they did. <br /> <br /> Mind control drugs: Are you referring to Progenitor Pharmacopoeist hypertech drugs - fictional Magickal substances? Conspiracy theories alleging the continuation of the MK-Ultra program? Naomi Klein wrote Shock Doctrine, which discusses that program. She is a Jewish liberal feminist.<br /> <br /> I don't know to what degree left or right wing people are more prone to conspiratorial thinking. There is a study that measured brain hemisphere dominance among participants whose political leanings were recorded. <b>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kI-un8rHP14&amp;ab_channel=BigThink</b><br /><br /> Scary Drug:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ToQ8PWYnu04&amp;t=1871s&amp;ab_channel=VICE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ToQ8PWYnu04&amp;t=1871s&amp;ab_channel=VICE\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ToQ8PWYnu04&amp;t=1871s&amp;ab_channel=VICE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ToQ8PWYnu04&amp;t=1871s&amp;ab_channel=VICE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T05:27:10-07:00","id":1420244,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">.... I don't want a Jewish golem.<br /> <br /> Remember all those conspiracy theories where Jews secretly run the world?</div> </div> </div> </div>What you don't want, in that case, it's Jews in Control.<br /> <br /> I'm not terribly sure if making the Technocracy to be ruled only by the WASP it's really a good thing, with all the movement to make them &quot;good guys&quot; and all. But I can see a point there, even if I'm not entirely agreeing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420199#post1420199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was more thinking that mage the ascension has the technocracy as a pastiche of various right wing conspiracy theories. New World Order, mind control drugs, globalists, secret bankers, academia...</div> </div> </div> </div>All of those were left-wing conspiracies at the time Mage came out, in the 90's. The most cursory reflection in the history of WoD and Mage will show these games came with heavy left wing ideology attached. And there's still valid leftist arguments there if you think about it.<br /> <br /> There's a lot of danger in jumping when you hear &quot;dog-whistles&quot; instead of actually <b>thinking </b>about the <b>material </b>(or real) scenarios. If you become...formulaic...you migth end defending what you're figthing against, at the moment you figth a smart enemy that can play with the symbolism.<br /> <br /> We're seeing this with the advent of this new &quot;revolutionary&quot; right, that screams to be figthing against the &quot;powers that be&quot; (aka, &quot;the man&quot; if u were a 90's leftist) as much if not more than the left - while actually aiding &quot;the man&quot;. We shouldn't start becoming &quot;pro system&quot; just because the enemy has become <i>symbolically</i> &quot;anty system&quot; (to attract the blue collar), don't you think? - If only because the system it's still kinda bad in most of the same ways it was in the 90's (change my mind).<br /> <br /> <s>Globalism</s> Imperialism it's still a thing where multi-national corps and rich countries exploit their influece on poor countries to keep them poor - that's what Mage tries to talk about with the whole Technocrats vs. hippies and native americans (or the more recent Disparate Alliance). Academia still has a lot of problems. It's still eurocentric as far as philosophy goes, and hasn't ceased to be functional to the interests of the dominant classes - if only because you can't pay quality education if you don't make a lot of money, that only big business can pay (and actually, there's a lot more to it). And <i>since when</i> we, leftists, have started to defend the public image of <b><i>Bankers</i></b>, of all people?<br /> (and it's not like there aren't secret bank accounts and such - ever heard of money laundry? - because that exists. Defending the unholly mess that are the global financial institutions, replete of demonstrable historical conspirations made to sink whole countries, requires some serious reflection about *what* you're figthing for)<br /> <br /> We're becoming a world where Control it's ever more prevalent. Where privacy doesn't exist and the goverment can know everything you do - In this world, the &quot;left/rigth&quot; have become paralel with the opposition &quot;private/state&quot;. That opposition it's, and always was, a fake one.<br /> Like the state was an institution that allways defends the oppressed - come on! - the state *it's* the police killing black people, the bureucracy *preventing* public education. Money it's power, and that power manifests itself by trying to control &quot;the state&quot; - that's one more fighting arena. Losing sight of the intimate relation between the rich, the state, and the ways oppression manifests, it's...very, very, dangerous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 10-26-2020, 09:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T16:14:06-07:00","id":1420339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420244#post1420244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What you don't want, in that case, it's Jews in Control.<br /> <br /> I'm not terribly sure if making the Technocracy to be ruled only by the WASP it's really a good thing, with all the movement to make them &quot;good guys&quot; and all. But I can see a point there, even if I'm not entirely agreeing.</div> </div> </div> </div>If the technocracy are villains, it is okay to make them upper class white people. If they are heroes, their ranks should reflect diversity. Who is being marginalized in the writing industry? &quot;I'm not terribly sure&quot; is a good starting position. We certainly don't want to make the mistake of dehumanizing or demonizing any demographic group and then making that the foundation on which future narrative development rests.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420244#post1420244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And <i>since when</i> we, leftists, have started to defend the public image of <b><i>Bankers</i></b>, of all people?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is helpful and informative. We are leftists. Until I hear the cry of &quot;Wait, we're here too.&quot; from right-leaning Mage enthusiasts, I can relate ideas on the bases of left wing principles shared by everyone. Power to the people.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420244#post1420244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(and it's not like there aren't secret bank accounts and such - ever heard of money laundry? - because that exists. Defending the unholly mess that are the global financial institutions, replete of demonstrable historical conspirations made to sink whole countries, requires some serious reflection about *what* you're figthing for)</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the things that astounded me was the 2012 HSBC money laundering scandal. I have always been against the war on drugs and the prison industry that feeds on it. On the other hand, I hoped that well meaning people in the judicial system and intelligence community were trying to &quot;follow the money&quot; with the goal of victory against global organized crime. A banker with a crisis of conscience approached the CIA with evidence of massive money laundering by HSBC. An investigation was done and the press got wind of it. HSBC had laundered billions of dollars for drug cartels and terrorists. Seriously, terrorists.<br /> <br /> The bank's top executives appeared before a Senate committee (still on YouTube), apologized, later payed fines and were never prosecuted. The street level civil forfeiture and busts for trafficking have continued after the stated goal of the war on drugs became clearly achievable and was intentionally failed.<br /> <br /> In Mage, the Technocracy would be concerned about the public's perception of an institution having legitimacy. Even when they don't rule an institution, but exert sufficient influence to diffuse their Magick and craft agent-covers, they have an interest in maintaining its image as something purporting to serve the masses. The Technocracy tell themselves that they serve the masses.<br /> <br /> To explain how such a system is allowed to continue consuming human lives and resources, I would say that its architects are afflicted with Clarity-Quiet and cannot extricate themselves from the cycle they initiated. It would also make sense that the Nephandi would be against the drug trade because it erodes sleepers' avatars, which makes them less appetizing to the Old Gods or whoever they are trying to please.<br /> <br /> The quotes above are taken in the order of appearance. This, I wanted to refer to at the end, because it is an important subject.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420244#post1420244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Academia still has a lot of problems. It's still eurocentric as far as philosophy goes, and hasn't ceased to be functional to the interests of the dominant classes - if only because you can't pay quality education if you don't make a lot of money, that only big business can pay (and actually, there's a lot more to it).</div> </div> </div> </div>This discussion, mostly Bret Weinstein talking, addresses eurocentrism and tuition cost.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=10XYi6E2QpI&amp;ab_channel=JREClips\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=10XY...annel=JREClips</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":".  single word I used changed, grammar 10-26-2020, 07:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T16:29:11-07:00","id":1420344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420244#post1420244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">if only because you can't pay quality education if you don't make a lot of money, that only big business can pay (and actually, there's a lot more to it). And <i>since when</i> we, leftists, have started to defend the public image of <b><i>Bankers</i></b>, of all people?<br /> (and it's not like there aren't secret bank accounts and such - ever heard of money laundry? - because that exists. Defending the unholly mess that are the global financial institutions, replete of demonstrable historical conspirations made to sink whole countries, requires some serious reflection about *what* you're figthing for)</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't. But people *think* you do. What with the 'yeah, leftists are funding riots' and 'secret antifa super army out to kill suburbanites and funded by rich millionaires'. And oh yeah, the 'The Jews are secret bankers with the majority of the world's wealth and are a secret conspiracy to destabilize countries and take over'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T17:36:40-07:00","id":1420356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420344#post1420344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You don't. But people *think* you do. What with the 'yeah, leftists are funding riots' and 'secret antifa super army out to kill suburbanites and funded by rich millionaires'. And oh yeah, the 'The Jews are secret bankers with the majority of the world's wealth and are a secret conspiracy to destabilize countries and take over'.</div> </div> </div> </div>The strategy employed by the black block fully accounts for the massive disadvantage they would face in armed conflict with suburbanites polygamously married to their firearms. Serious people across the political spectrum are not saying that these criminals think they can overwhelm everyone else by force. However they raise money, they are running a low cost game that appeals to public sympathy.<br /> <br /> They are betting on a strategic principle &quot;First they ignore you, then they laugh at you, then they fight you, then you win.&quot; (leaving Trump and Gandhi out of this. It's not about who actually said this.) It's the &quot;then they fight you, then you win.&quot; that is important. While few of these miscreants are actually prepared to die for their &quot;cause&quot;, which is not liberal, each is anticipating the possibility of someone else being killed by members of an opposed group. While the insane radical professor wisely stays home, footage of an unarmed college kid being killed by a member of an armed group is GOLD for these people, no matter what lead up to the incident. At least, that is what they are betting on.<br /> <br /> The audience whose sympathy they are trying to illicit are scarred of them. This isn't entirely related to the threat of violence. Censorship that appears to be coming from the left produces right wing election victories. When people are afraid to ponder a though out loud that has not been rehearsed for proper self-censorship, it doesn't matter if they hold left wing views. If they are fearful of losing their job, being dogpiled, shunned, etc., they will bring those feelings into the private space that is the voting booth.<br /> <br /> The number of people who have been pushed out of polite society for failure to conform to ideological demands of a tiny fringe has grown to the point where the growing mass of outcasts all want same thing. They want social justice ideology, which is not liberal, off their backs. Their friends and family who have witnessed the outrage mob's damage on the person begin to question whatever views they held in alignment with said ideology. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":".  clarity, not the paradox kind 10-28-2020, 10:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T05:21:59-07:00","id":1420432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420344#post1420344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You don't. But people *think* you do. What with the 'yeah, leftists are funding riots' and 'secret antifa super army out to kill suburbanites and funded by rich millionaires'. And oh yeah, the 'The Jews are secret bankers with the majority of the world's wealth and are a secret conspiracy to destabilize countries and take over'.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're not going to defuse this, though, by refusing to place jews in <i>any </i>positions of power within your fiction. On the contrary, one risks to generate a mystification of the subject, if it becomes tabu. Wouldn't be a much better service to say that A jew that happens to be powerful, isn't necessarily evil?, facing the stereotype head on by depicting jews in a different ligth instead of refusing to depict them at all?<br /> <br /> To say that the Board of the Syndicate &quot;it's obiously made of Jews&quot; would be a fascist caricature. To make a Jew golem, not so much. The nuances here being: A) It's ItX. They're not the secret bankers of anyone - they're just the secret scientists B) It's A Technocrat, that just happens to be A jew, not &quot;jews&quot; - the Lions of Zion are still enemies, and not the secret masters of the Technocracy. C) Nobody was saying that the golem it's the de-facto leader of ItX, that would be taking the thunder from Kepler - Inner Circle &gt; Control<br /> <br /> And even then, saying that a jew *can't possibly* be on the inner circle out of fear it would be regarded as a fascist caricature...I would think that should be avoidable by *not* making the character a vulgar caricature - you're not contractualy obligated to pay homage to ALL fascist expectations. Art allows us to re-define stuff: Orcs were a racist stereotype, but that doesn't mean one should forbbide them. Orcs are regarded as cool nowdays, and often aren't the bad guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 10-27-2020, 08:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T06:05:34-07:00","id":1420441,"title":"","content":"Yeah. That's fine and true.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T14:28:48-07:00","id":1420550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420432#post1420432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You're not going to defuse this, though, by refusing to place jews in <i>any </i>positions of power within your fiction. On the contrary, one risks to generate a mystification of the subject, if it becomes tabu. Wouldn't be a much better service to say that A jew that happens to be powerful, isn't necessarily evil?, facing the stereotype head on by depicting jews in a different ligth instead of refusing to depict them at all?<br /> <br /> To say that the Board of the Syndicate &quot;it's obiously made of Jews&quot; would be a fascist caricature. To make a Jew golem, not so much. The nuances here being: A) It's ItX. They're not the secret bankers of anyone - they're just the secret scientists B) It's A Technocrat, that just happens to be A jew, not &quot;jews&quot; - the Lions of Zion are still enemies, and not the secret masters of the Technocracy. C) Nobody was saying that the golem it's the de-facto leader of ItX, that would be taking the thunder from Kepler - Inner Circle &gt; Control<br /> <br /> And even then, saying that a jew *can't possibly* be on the inner circle out of fear it would be regarded as a fascist caricature...I would think that should be avoidable by *not* making the character a vulgar caricature - you're not contractualy obligated to pay homage to ALL fascist expectations. Art allows us to re-define stuff: Orcs were a racist stereotype, but that doesn't mean one should forbbide them. Orcs are regarded as cool nowdays, and often aren't the bad guys.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would take things a step further. If you are playing Traditions, your characters are organized into a Cabal. The very name &quot;cabal&quot; implies clandestine behavior. Being clandestine is a survival necessity in a world dominated by the Technocracy. Trying to get some institutional influence is on the priority list of a Cabal, because if they want to do Ritual Magick and score successes, having large numbers of Acolytes is highly recommended.<br /> <br /> Let's say you have a Jewish character, a Tradition mage, and his Tradition is Not Celestial Chorus. Let's make him a Virtual Adept. The Cabal has formed a tech startup company that makes VR games for the psychedelic community. Somehow, the company markets to this audience while maintaining deniability on the issue of hallucinogens, which are beginning to be recognized as having therapeutic uses. It's a corporate conspiracy and he's a company executive. They are trying to put micro-dosing gamers in contact with Umbrood to trigger an awakening among sleepers. The Umbrood are related to Native American mythology and have nothing to do with Judaism. <br /> <br /> A Jewish character is doing something clandestine, in cooperation with other characters who are not Jewish, to achieve a goal that is not related to his Jewishness. When he is not devoting his time to the goals of his Cabal, he does culturally Jewish things, seen in a separate context from the intrigue plot. <br /> <br /> If this were a Netflix show, it would be up to the writers to properly establish the context, the premise of WoD (a world of conspiracies), before the tech startup plot is introduced.<br /> <br /> A Jewish banker and another Jewish banker hatching a plot is objectively objectionable (a little word salad). <br /> <br /> If you want to look at a real example of conspirators self-identified as Christians, check out, &quot;The Family: The Secret Fundamentalism at the Heart of American Power, 2008, Jeff Sharlet&quot;. He did interviews still on YouTube about the book.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T07:19:17-07:00","id":1420681,"title":"","content":"Technically the a member of the craft masons (which is the dark age version of the artificers guild) wouldn't be a magical construct like a golem in the first place. The order of reason (precursor to the modern technocracy) was against such things, at best he would be a human augmented with clockwork type organs.<br /> <br /> There wasn't even a Control back then, that name didn't come about till the late 1960's. You had the Inner Circle and it had 8 conventions","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3953,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","user":"Dwight","date":". 10-28-2020, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T09:15:59-07:00","id":1420694,"title":"","content":"Yeah someone pointed out to me elsewhere I confused Control with the In we circle and Control was a mechanism Technocratic Masters could tap into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T10:57:04-07:00","id":1420705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420681#post1420681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Technically the a member of the craft masons (which is the dark age version of the artificers guild) wouldn't be a magical construct like a golem in the first place. The order of reason (precursor to the modern technocracy) was against such things, at best he would be a human augmented with clockwork type organs.<br /> <br /> There wasn't even a Control back then, that name didn't come about till the late 1960's. You had the Inner Circle and it had 8 conventions</div> </div> </div> </div>Obviously, I was just messing around when I came up with the five that included the golem. It was not presented in a way that one would expect it to be taken too seriously. Going back to the goal of the post...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control#post1416884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So how about some different ideas or even fleshed out characters that make up Control. I liked how some hints of Inhuman forces are taking over the Conventions like The Computer In Autochthonia, but this usually is depicted outside of Control. But it would be funny if Control was just five different inhuman god things standing on each other\u2019s shoulders wearing a human trench coat and maybe they don\u2019t even know about each other.<br /> <br /> There is the idea Control is heavily if not completely compromised by the Nephandi.<br /> <br /> And then there is the fact that Conventions constantly reimagined themselves so Archscientists In Control would kind of be the only remnants of their older conventions, as well as the idea of many being archaic, so the irony of the most advanced Scientists are fellas that would use clockwork nano-machines made of wood and glass.<br /> <br /> But how many members would you imagine are in Control? Have you made actual characters for Control in your games?<br /> <br /> I like the idea after the dimensional anomaly that banished masters and above beyond the gauntlet the techies lost most of their control over individual members so while they are organized they are much less supervised with much less oversight. They still have a hierarchy and duty, kind of like the Garou Nation, but they have more freedom to achieve their goals as they wish it\u2019s just you are cut off from most resources unless you tie yourself deeper into the organization and duties.</div> </div> </div> </div>The way I would handle the question of Nephandi, is to first imagine who each member was before any got tricked into that Caul business. You want them to be part of a story with conflicts. NWO vs Syndicate is the one everyone thinks of. Let's imagine something more original. <br /> <br /> They are in a place removed from the Earth and are observing it from a distance. The agenda is both to prevent beliefs from spreading that undermine the Consensus, pushing it backwards AND to stop hyper-tech from coming out that would cause paradox-like effects or global backlash, &quot;market corrections&quot;. There is a schedule that moves at a safe, specified pace, the Time Table.<br /> <br /> One of them is the most vocal dictator when it comes to enforcing this Timetable. There might be another who is thinking, &quot;You are hobbling us.&quot;, &quot;us&quot; being their own convention and many lower level transhumanists throughout the Union. <br /> <br /> I could picture a power triangle between the Void Engineer, the Iterator and the Syndicate rep. <br /> <br /> The Void Engineer is the woman on the cover of the first VE book, sitting on sailing ship. She gets a lot of information from Earth Frontiers Division and she is worried about global warming. As a Dimension Science Master, she is familiar with the Triat, consisting of the Wyrm, Weaver and Wild. She knows that Gaian Umbrood must play an important role in combatting the Wyrm. She has difficulty convincing her fellow technocrats that there is a Spirit of the Earth. She often listens to the song, &quot;Carbon&quot; by VNV Nation. This annoys the Syndicate rep who is quite proud of the accomplishments of the petrochemical industry. <br /> <br /> The Iteration-X cyborg man is ready to terraform the planet, because he thinks that we can just adapt humanity to a completely different biosphere through cybernetics. If necessary, robots could store human embryos in a facility like that depicted in, &quot;I Am Mother.&quot;. He wants to desalinate the Oceans completely to ensure there is enough fresh water for 11+ billion people. <br /> <br /> The Syndicate rep is a man from Alberta, Canada. He believes that large parts of the Earth can be sacrificed for economic progress, as has been done with the oil sands project, and that technology will solve the problem later. To sustain the global economic bubble, he realizes that humanity needs to get into asteroid mining, building geosynchronous high-orbit solar collectors and otherwise building space infrastructure. He needs the Void Engineer, but is not down with her Gaian-agenda. <br /> <br /> Take any one of these and you can add them to a power triangle with the remaining two conventions. Determine who is Nephandi AFTER fleshing them out as they were before getting duped. Then add Nephandic personal horror to their story.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-28T19:47:20-07:00","id":1420751,"title":"","content":"I think a small wistful part of Control still loves earth.<br /> <br /> Sometimes they send down golems and avatars to walk amongst humanity, having a thrill from buying groceries at a store or shopping at a mall. Marvelling at the state of humanity now, despite the fact that they were the ones to bring this about.<br /> <br /> Some small part of Control still remembers the wizards in their tower, and despises them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T14:12:48-07:00","id":1420867,"title":"","content":"I imagine any &quot;Control&quot; type Technocrats, due to their refined outlooks and isolation, to be unable to honestly tell the difference between their Procedures and regular science. As long as the desired results are achieved, it makes no difference to them. Reality bends to their actions and viewpoints.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T14:48:45-07:00","id":1420875,"title":"","content":"My take on Control? I'm a fan of the Revised Convention Books, where Control got cut off from Earth by the Dimensional Anomaly and is no longer in control of the Union. Instead, it now heads up Threat Null.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T15:27:46-07:00","id":1420877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420875#post1420875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My take on Control? I'm a fan of the Revised Convention Books, where Control got cut off from Earth by the Dimensional Anomaly and is no longer in control of the Union. Instead, it now heads up Threat Null.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is how I run it. Techies just like the Traditions lost their masters to beyond and the newbs built up things as the new generation. People crap on revised but I rather like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T16:03:56-07:00","id":1420881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420877#post1420877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is how I run it. Techies just like the Traditions lost their masters to beyond and the newbs built up things as the new generation. People crap on revised but I rather like it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really like: &quot;Avatar Storm never happened, but Threat Null Exists (for a different reason)&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T16:06:56-07:00","id":1420883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420881#post1420881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <br /> I really like: &amp;quot;Avatar Storm never happened, but Threat Null Exists (for a different reason)&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember that was an option, I forgot what the reason for them existing was in such a case? Is it just techies got isolated from the rest of the Technocracy in the Umbra and became Null without a cosmic storm, or was it some other reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T16:21:01-07:00","id":1420884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420883#post1420883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I remember that was an option, I forgot what the reason for them existing was in such a case? Is it just techies got isolated from the rest of the Technocracy in the Umbra and became Null without a cosmic storm, or was it some other reason.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Disembodiment and Void Adaption (M20 core, p88). I don't apply this so strictly to the players - three months and you can never come back, because I don't want them to be hesitant to explore. It can explain Threat Null.<br /> <br /> You can also have Control exist and Threat Null be twin NPCs from a dark parallel reality. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T16:37:04-07:00","id":1420887,"title":"","content":"Disembodiment and Void Adaptation have always been a thing. And if you're going with the notion that it suddenly became much more severe, you're basically saying \u201cAvatar Storm\u201d save only for its effects on the Gauntlet. <br /> <br /> Satyros has mentioned that his own head-canon is that the Avatar Storm <i>did</i> happen \u2014 past tense. I'm inclined to agree.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T18:43:30-07:00","id":1420914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1416884-ideas-for-control?p=1420887#post1420887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Disembodiment and Void Adaptation have always been a thing. And if you're going with the notion that it suddenly became much more severe, you're basically saying \u201cAvatar Storm\u201d save only for its effects on the Gauntlet.<br /> <br /> Satyros has mentioned that his own head-canon is that the Avatar Storm <i>did</i> happen \u2014 past tense. I'm inclined to agree.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The aspect of the storm that I like is the similarity of its aftermath to The Grey Wastes, an outer plane from d&amp;d cosmology. Everything is twisted.<br /> <br /> However, I like the idea of longstanding Chantries. At least the wealth of knowledge and relics accumulated by the Traditions remains somewhere - and large Chantries require a Horizon Realm. The Avatar Storm wipes out everything the traditions accomplished and forces them to be second-rate technomancers by adaptation to the Technocratic Consensus. No wonder so much of the player-base just want to play Technocratic Union. Why be a techno-shaman when you can be a Void Engineer?<br /> <br /> The Avatar Storm so diminishes the Traditions that the idea of The Crafts being of any interest, as a third group, has even less appeal. Who does that leave to challenge the Technocracy? Oh yeah, The Nephandi. So, Mage becomes all about fighting demons - and not even fun ones. The theme of Book Of The Fallen is organized bullying, abuse and sadism. Really? &quot;Don't succumb to the enemy, lest you become such.&quot; and &quot;Don't play characters after succumbing to the organized pressures of the Nephandi - Who Control The Technocracy From The Top Down.&quot; (yes, I know the degree of infiltration varies by ST). Where are they trying to go, narratively?<br /> <br /> If you eliminate the Avatar Storm, you restore some dignity to the Traditions. The Crafts become a viable faction. The Technocracy is challenged by something other than just pure evil; the enemies that it made in the Umbra in its efforts to expand the Gauntlet. Umbral Lords with pocket dimensions, in my head-canon, are likely to trust the Traditions and be incredibly wary of Void Ships.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":26467,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","user":"HorizonParty2021","date":".  spelling 10-29-2020, 09:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T20:21:57-07:00","id":1420920,"title":"","content":"To be fair, most of the Horizon Realms fell <i>before</i> the Avatar Storm. The Storm merely finished off the last of them. And it's arguable that if they hadn't been weakened prior to the Storm, they might have been able to weather it. <br /> <br /> As for the Void Engineers: frankly, they were the faction <i>most</i> devastated by the Storm; not even the Dreamspeakers suffered as badly as they did (largely because the Dreamspeakers are less about crossing over to the Umbra than they are about communing with spirits). <br /> <br /> And far from devastating the Traditions, the Avatar Storm likely <i>saved</i> them: it forced the Technocracy to back off and take stock of what they were doing, giving the Traditions a chance to recover. Sure, the Traditions lost their Archmasters; but the Traditions had never relied on their Archmasters the way the Technocracy had relied on Control.<br /> <br /> In terms of Void Engineers vs. Umbral Lords, I definitely agree that the relationship tends to be antagonistic. I tend to look at James Cameron's <i>Avatar</i> as an example of a crew of Void Engineers laying siege to an Umbral Realm in order to mine it for Quintessence (excuse me; \u201cUnobtainium\u201d). Most of the peaceful explorers in their ranks left when the Avatar Storm hit (the culmination to the persistent rumors that the Convention was getting ready to abandon the Union), and the bulk of the ones who remained were the more militant Earth First types, reminiscent of colonialism when they're not focused on defending the Earth from alien invaders. <br /> <br /> The Traditions got taken down a peg by the Avatar Storm; the Conventions got taken down <i>two</i> pegs, except for the Void Engineers who were nearly destroyed. <br /> <br /> And the Crafts were hurt even less by the Storm than the Traditions were: the bulk of them didn't have any Archmasters in the Umbral Realms in the first place, so they didn't lose anything. Where they <i>did</i> get hammered was when the Union lashed out at them, forcing them into hiding (and in the case of the Kopa Loei, being driven <i>so</i> far into hiding that everyone thought that they had been wiped out). And had that not happened, the Disparate Alliance would never have happened either. But that's all separate from the Storm. <br /> <br /> As for the Nephandi, the idea as I see it is that they've been infiltrating <i>everyone</i>: Technocracy, Traditions, and even the Disparate Alliance (which was founded specifically to fight the Nephandic infiltration). It's what they <i>do</i>: infiltrate and subvert. I tend <i>not</i> to go with the idea that the Technephandi run the Union; but that's also part of the reason why I prefer the post-Storm notion where the Union got cut off from Control long enough to establish an independent leadership of their own that wasn't particularly receptive to Control coming back and trying to reassert itself. <i>Control</i> may have succumbed to Nephandic infiltration; but the Earthside Union (including the rechristened Void Sentinels) hasn't, yet. The Nephandi are working hard to subvert them, too; but they're not there yet, just as they haven't successfully subverted the Traditions. Yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-29-2020, 11:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T20:54:12-07:00","id":1420924,"title":"","content":"Incidentally, I'm personally rather fond of playing Enlightened Scientists (<i>not</i> technocrats, thank you very much; the arrogance of scientists, engineers, and academics thinking they know how to run your life better than you do is a major turn-off for me); but I wouldn't play the Traditions as second-rate technomancers, even (no, <i>especially</i>) in the wake of the Avatar Storm. <br /> <br /> The Avatar Storm didn't force the Traditions to adapt to the Technocratic Consensus, unless you consider the harsher Paradox rules of MRev to be an effect of the Avatar Storm. But even there, it's not so much that they had to align their views to the Technocratic Consensus as it is that they actually had to look at the Consensus that they, as a whole, had gotten into the habit of ignoring; and when they looked at it, they decided to do something about what they didn't like. In my head-canon, the rise of the Avatar Storm was followed by efforts by the Traditions to enact paradigm shifts in their local Reality Zones, leading to the Technocracy losing a lot of ground that it had been taking for granted. The Consensus is not, and never has been, predominantly Technocratic; that the Technocracy ever thought so is just another mark of their hubris. But after the Reckoning, it gradually became even less so as the Traditions managed to strengthen Mythic Threads in those Reality Zones that remained Technocratic, and even managed to flip a few of them into being Localized Zones. Riffing off of something you've mentioned elsewhere, I tend to think that pre-Storm mages were <i>more</i> likely to unthinkingly accept Technocrat-friendly Paradigms like materialism than more recent mages are: when you go back to basics and reexamine your assumptions, you're more likely to uncover the ones you've just been taking for granted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-30-2020, 12:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T21:02:26-07:00","id":1420927,"title":"","content":"One thing that bothered me, wouldn't all Archmaster Techies either need to vanish, step in line or be deemed a risk? Tradition Archmages seems to run the gammut of being social or hermit, but Techies I feel would really demand at least a tolkien sharing of resources or research or deem them a risk.<br /> <br /> Or Exemplar Technocrats they seem like they would be treated maybe like forces of nature/resources like the greater technocracy would treat them and their resources as one like associating them with Dyson Spheres, Satellites.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T21:19:08-07:00","id":1420931,"title":"","content":"Only slightly moreso than Masters. That said, my view of it is that the Technocracy simply doesn't prioritize Archmasters the same way the Traditions do: the Traditions are, at their roots, about pursuing personal Ascension, and thus are more likely to produce Willworkers who are constantly trying to scale the ladder to ever-higher levels of Arete. Technocrats also have the impulse to achieve more and more Enlightenment; but that's tempered by their focus on the Masses. While the Union has lost its way over the centuries and now is less about improving the lot of the Masses and more about running their lives, they still tend to focus a lot on that side of things \u2014 arguably to the detriment of self-improvement. Heck, their system of Conditioning arguably should have a tendency to hinder further development of Enlightenment. <br /> <br /> Which is a long way of saying that I don't think that there <i>are</i> that many Technocratic Archmasters. And in games where Control is still running the Union, those Technocrats who attain Archmastery are likely compelled to join Control, removing them from Earthly affairs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-30-2020, 12:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T21:32:00-07:00","id":1420932,"title":"","content":"Oh excellent point about Personal vs Collective emphasis. I like the idea from earlier editions that as a whole the Technocracy doesn't even necessarily believe in Ascension. They just further their goals with a few visionaries having a lot of ideas about perfection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T21:43:00-07:00","id":1420933,"title":"","content":"Yeah. The technocracy should probably also have a lot bigger focus on things like tools, infrastructure. And having the weight of society behind them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-29T21:52:20-07:00","id":1420934,"title":"","content":"Interestingly, the upcoming <b>Technocracy Reloaded</b> doesn't really have much of anything in terms of Technocratic Procedures, per se; the whole section that in any other book would be addressing Effects and Rotes common to the faction instead addresses the Technocracy's Wonders \u2014 with Sphere ratings given to each for those times when a Technomancer needs to improvise the Effect as a Procedure instead of just using the Wonder. So yeah; a greater emphasis on tools and infrastructure. <br /> <br /> Plus there's a lot of word count devoted to \u201cTerranorming\u201d and moving the Overton Window (in Mage-speak, shifting Reality Zones); so yeah, having the weight of society behind them too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-30-2020, 02:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-31T11:21:19-07:00","id":1421185,"title":"","content":"I definitely agree also on the collectivist-individualist divide which is at the core of a great deal of the Union-Tradition/Disparate divide and that technocrats probably are more inclined to actually use their works and alter the world with them while the traditions/disparates are more inclined to develop themselves and maybe alter their surroundings along the way.<br /> <br /> As far as CONTROL itself, I\u2019m not super well versed in the canonical lore surrounding it so forgive me if I make any elementary blunders here while offering my ideas and notions.<br /> <br /> I\u2019ve always thought of CONTROL as something similar to the gestalt mystical paradigm which the Traditions seem to dedicate themselves to collectively. Whatever it is, the concept of Magick or Ascension or what, it\u2019s presence is represented in the shared Horizon of the Council and most famously with their table of nine chairs (and how the appearance of the tenth seat is a sign of the end times approaching).<br /> <br /> In a like matter, I imagine that CONTROL is the gestalt paradigm of the technocratic union at any given moment in history. While the Council is focused upon hearing the voices of its seated members and pursuing Magick and Ascension, CONTROL embodies the values of unity, achievement, and genius that guides the technocrats.<br /> <br /> While it may be the eldest technocrats who determine the time table and whose machinations set the path forward for the whole of the union, it is the concept of CONTROL above them which instills the hungry march towards understanding, power, and (surely enough) control.<br /> <br /> In a way, both Horizon and CONTROL serve the same purpose for their respective organizations. They embody the collective over-avatar of the groups they patronize. The quest towards Magick and Genius.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}